  "$schema": "https://schemas.cerberauth.com/identity-provider/draft/2024-09/provider.schema.json",
  "name": "LoginRadius",
  "abstract": "Commercial cloud customer identity platform. Professional and Enterprise plans cover passkeys, passwordless login by magic link or SMS and email OTP, OTP-based MFA, SAML, OIDC, OAuth and JWT federation, and SCIM. Enterprise adds an identity orchestration engine, adaptive MFA, federated SSO, consent management, multi-brand deployment, regional data storage, private cloud and a 25,000 requests-per-second rate limit. Billed on monthly active users with a 14-day free trial. Acquired by Volaris Group in August 2026 and said to operate independently.",
  "identifier": "loginradius",
  "status": "active",
